    "youtube_description": "The notice says ninety seconds. Your monologue is three minutes.\nMilo's favourite speech is Cassius from Julius Caesar, and it goes out the door and down the hall. In Ghost Light he typed comedic, under 90 seconds, Oscar Wilde, and up came Lady Hunstanton from A Woman of No Importance, 1:09. Free on the App Store. Built by a working actor. The voice is AI.\n#monologue #audition #actorslife #acting",
    "instagram": "The notice says ninety seconds. Your monologue is three minutes.\n\nMilo brought Cassius from Julius Caesar. It went out the door and down the hall.\n\nWhat he did in Ghost Light:\n1. Tap Search.\n2. Type: comedic, under 90 seconds, Oscar Wilde.\n3. Open Lady Hunstanton from A Woman of No Importance. 1:09, one page.\n\nFree on the App Store, built by a working actor. Link in bio. The voice is AI.\n\n#monologue #audition #actorslife #actorsofinstagram #oscarwilde"
